# /undo after two turns that change one file: `a.txt` created as `one`, then
# read and overwritten with `two` (the read is xfx's: its `write_file` refuses
# to replace a file the session has not read, and fx's takes it as well). Then
# /undo three times: Restored, Deleted (was newly created), Nothing to undo.
gateway undo-turns.json
wait 3
type write one please
key Enter
wait 5
type write two please
key Enter
wait 5
snap before-undo
workls before-undo
type /undo
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap undo1
workls after-undo1
type /undo
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap undo2
workls after-undo2
type /undo
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap undo3
workls after-undo3
